offset_right = 1542.5
offset_bottom = 972.0
text = "Drive the cart and dodge the incoming projectiles.
Movment allows you to attack back at the enemies.

Dealing damage charges your Ultimate bar.
Pressing 'Space' will launch a driver shot that deals more damage.

You have three sets of lives: Par 3, Par 4, Par 5.  
Each life gives a specific amount of health:

Par 3 = 3 Hits
Par 4 = 4 Hits
Par 5 = 5 Hits

For each life you lose, you will gain less score: 

Par 3 = 100%
Par 4 = 75%
Par 5 = 50%"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_xqkvd")
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 3

